Lamna Healthcare Company must create a Conditional Access policy that requires MFA for all users. Two emergency access accounts must never be affected, and the policy must log its results without enforcing them until the security team approves it.

How should you complete the script? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.

```powershell
$params = @{
    displayName = "Require MFA for all users"
    state = [[1]]
    conditions = @{
        applications = @{ includeApplications = @("All") }
        users = @{
            includeUsers = @("All")
            [[2]] = @($breakGlass1Id, $breakGlass2Id)
        }
    }
    grantControls = @{ operator = "OR"; builtInControls = @([[3]]) }
}
[[4]] -BodyParameter $params
```
